***SPOILERS***

Key point here - if you've only made it to the castle level, you haven't come
anywhere close to where the wizard is.  You should be able to find several
trapdoors in the back entrance of the castle, or a stairway in the eastern
maze on the level leading down to the next level.  However, you'll probably
want to teleport down to at least level 50 and work your way up to find the
wizard.  A hint about how to know where he is:  put on a blindfold and then
apply a mirror to yourself (use '.' for direction).  This may take several
tries, but eventually you'll figure out whether he's above, below, or on
the same level as you, and a general idea of how far.

